      "content": "thanks. i look at the logs and the error code is just generic \"payment_intent_authentication_required\". i think i might be missing a step in the frontend flow for the SCA (strong customer authentication). how do i actually implement that redirect or popup logic so it doesn't just fail with that 402 error?",
      "source": "evaluator"
